As athletic as she was, she also enjoyed music and painting. On Saturday 29th June 2002, Lisa, who was 21 at the time, was at home. She lived in an apartment with a roommate next door to her parents, but she was moving out into a new apartment the next day, Sunday. Lisa was looking forward to the future. Not only was she moving to a new place, but she was also starting a new job later that week at a call centre. She had plans to go back to school too, with the aim to become a TV sports announcer.
除了运动天赋，她还喜欢音乐和绘画。2002年6月29日星期六，当时21岁的丽莎在家。她和室友住在一间公寓里，就在父母家隔壁，但第二天（星期日）她就要搬进新公寓了。丽莎对未来充满期待。她不仅要搬到新住处，那周晚些时候还要在一家呼叫中心开始一份新工作。她还计划重返校园，目标是成为一名电视体育播音员。

