next day. But Lisa told them not to worry, she would be fine. Lisa made her way to the Jungle Night Club on Skinner Street in downtown Nanaimo. It's now called Club 241. She arrived there just before midnight. Lisa actually used to work in the club. Police say it wasn't a place they readily associated with trouble. Being a long weekend, downtown was a happening place, there were people out everywhere having
